{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00877","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 君马黄 · 李白","name":"鼓吹曲辞 君马黄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君马黄，我马白。\n马色虽不同，人心本无隔。\n共作游冶盘，双行洛阳陌。\n长劒既照曜，高冠何赩赫。\n各有千金裘，俱爲五侯客。\n猛虎落陷穽，壮夫时屈厄。\n相知在急难，独好亦何益。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00877.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00877","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}